  "notes": [
    "No candidate passed the development gate; confirmation was not run.",
    "Large models are untrained bootstraps. Tiny training is pipeline validation only, not strength evidence.",
    "No production assets/source changed, no deployment.",
    "Exact executed CPU source precedes newline formatting; native match source also precedes startup-cleanup/provenance additions.",
    "Large package weights remain ignored locally; package configs/tensor hashes and source checkpoint enable rebuilding."
